   "date": "2019-04-08T06:09:42Z",
   "subject": "morphol.disparity issue",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\" dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p>Dear all,</p>\r\n<p><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>I came across a minor issue using the <b>morpho.disparity</b> function in the latest version of geomorph.</p>\r\n<p>So taking the example from help file, if one run the following code that include\r\n<span>covariates (a complex model), then a list is returned with <span>extractable </span>objects.</span></p>\r\n<p><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(189,19,152)\">data(plethodon)</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(189,19,152)\">Y.gpa&lt;-gpagen(plethodon$land, print.progress = FALSE)    #GPA-alignment</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(189,19,152)\">gdf &lt;- geomorph.data.frame(Y.gpa, species = plethodon$species, </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:rgb(189,19,152)\">site = plethodon$site)</span></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(189,19,152)\">MD &lt;- morphol.disparity(coords ~ Csize + species*site, groups= ~ species, </span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(189,19,152)\">                        data = gdf, iter = 999, print.progress = FALSE)</span></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(189,19,152)\">MD$Procrustes.var</span></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>But, if we now make the model a bit simpler and exclude covariates, then even though the disparity calculation is performed, the MD object will return as NULL. </div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(189,19,152)\">MD &lt;- morphol.disparity(coords ~ 1, data = gdf, iter = 999, print.progress = FALSE)</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(189,19,152)\">MD</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(189,19,152)\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(189,19,152)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">It is an easy fix though and simply require that an extra function (i.e. &#39;return&#39;) to be added to the script.</span></span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(189,19,152)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">... </span></span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(189,19,152)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(189,19,152)\">if (is.null(groups)) {</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(189,19,152)\"><b>    </b>pv.obs &lt;- pv</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(189,19,152)\">    <b>return(</b></span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:16px;color:rgb(189,19,152)\"><b>pv.obs</b></span><span style=\"color:rgb(189,19,152)\"><b>)</b></span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(189,19,152)\">    cat(&quot;No factor in formula or model terms from which to define groups.\\n&quot;)</span></div>\r\n<br>\r\n</span></span></div>\r\n<div>all the best,</div>\r\n<div>Mohamad</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<u></u>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nNär du har kontakt med oss på Uppsala universitet med e-post så innebär det att vi behandlar dina personuppgifter. För att läsa mer om hur vi gör det kan du läsa här: <a href=\"http://www.uu.se/om-uu/dataskydd-personuppgifter/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uu.se/om-uu/dataskydd-personuppgifter/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485014016000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0kS2ZUSsQKeoXmCoQdxKcY\">http://www.uu.se/om-uu/dataskydd-personuppgifter/</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nE-mailing Uppsala University means that we will process your personal data. For more information on how this is performed, please read here: <a href=\"http://www.uu.se/en/about-uu/data-protection-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uu.se/en/about-uu/data-protection-policy&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485014016000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2YnNCEpiuj8TKkrCEv5PwV\">http://www.uu.se/en/about-uu/data-protection-policy</a>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
    ]
   ]
